flowchart LR
    I[Delivery Intent\ncontract identity] --> C[Context\ncontext_bound]
    C --> P[Plan\nplan_approved]
    P --> E[Execute\nexecuted_scoped]
    E --> V[Verify\nverified]
    V --> R[Review\nreview_complete]
    R --> D[Deliver\ndeliverable_bound]
    D --> G{Identity +\nartifacts + QA?}
    G -->|全部一致| L[delivery_ready\n交給 release lane]
    G -->|任一缺口| B[blocked_delivery\n固定 reason code]
